=\"italic\"> every + day</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I use my yoga mat <span class=\"strong\"> every day</span>. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I go to yoga class <span class=\"strong\"> twice a week</span>."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le04ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose 3 activities at the local recreation center."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find the times of the classes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Note how often the classes are."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the chart with the information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share the information with a partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Activity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Times\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How Often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find out about information about activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the frequency of activities. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I pass on information to a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "t